---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { business, services } from '../data/business';
---
<Base
  title="About | Spokane Blower Doors"
  description="Locally owned building performance testing company in Post Falls, Idaho serving North Idaho and Eastern Washington. Call 509-903-8595."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>About Spokane Blower Doors</h1>
      <p class="lead">{business.ownership} We help home builders, HVAC contractors, remodelers, and homeowners across {business.serviceArea} pass code, earn energy credits, and build tighter, more efficient homes.</p>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>{business.weeklyTesting} Our goal is simple: show up when scheduled, test accurately, and get you clear results fast so your project keeps moving.</p>
      <h2>Why builders work with us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Response within 24 hours</li>
        <li>Appointments typically available 5 days out</li>
        <li>Fast, clear reports and code forms</li>
        <li>{business.builderFamiliarity}</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Standards and credentials</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>{business.credential}</li>
        <li>Testing per ANSI/RESNET/ICC 301, 310, and 380</li>
        <li>Washington State Energy Code (WSEC) and IECC test procedures</li>
        <li>Calibrated {business.equipment} testing equipment</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What you get</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>CFM50 and ACH50 results</li>
        <li>Total duct leakage and leakage to outside</li>
        <li>A written report or completed code form</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Services</h2>
      <ul>
        {services.map((s) => <li><a href={`/services/${s.slug}/`}>{s.name}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready to schedule?</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={business.phoneHref}>{business.phone}</a> or <a href="/contact/">send a message</a>. Service is by appointment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
